  "description": "Database errors that reach the transaction entry: which are retried (the whole transaction, at most 3 attempts) and which reason each one ends as. 'connect' stands for a failure before any SQLSTATE. A DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE carries metadata dependency=db. Errors the module returns itself pass through.",
